#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Lightweight, SEO-first theme for businesses, agencies and blogs. Drag-and-drop header and footer builder with top bar, sticky and transparent header, header search and a mobile menu panel. Seven section patterns, sidebar layouts, blog grid or list, reading progress bar, author box, related posts and per-page header, footer and sidebar options. No jQuery: one stylesheet and one small script."
msgstr ""

